  "details": "The container-tools module contains tools for working with containers, notably podman, buildah, skopeo, and runc.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * net/[http:](http:) golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n  * crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * container-tools:rhel8: buildah RPM has the wrong version (JIRA:AlmaLinux-272014)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
